tools.description:
Editor projects: list, open, create from a brief/template, settings, review→rendering, versions.
Actions:
- list: List your editor projects
- get: Full project: settings, shots, stills, overlays, av_plan, final output
- create: New project without a source video. body: {origin: template|brief|production, template_id|brief|production_id, ratio?, workflow?, shot_count?, language?}
- analyze 💰: Reverse a reference video into an editable project. body: {source, title?, mode?, chunk_sec?, language?}
- composite: Compose mode: build a new free project from already-rendered shots of other projects. body: {title?, pieces:[{rid, n, in?, out?}], audio?: clip|music|both, unify?: bool, strength?: 0-1, join?: none|fade|smooth}
- settings: Change workflow, resolution, ratio, gen_mode, vo_language, title, refs…
- replan: Re-cut a reference-video project's shot grid without re-analysing (review only; shot text is inherited by time overlap). body: {mode: fixed|merge|trim, chunk_sec, workflow}
- reblueprint: Re-extract per-shot subject / location / on-screen text when the analysis left them empty (free, does not re-watch the video)
- notes: Turn the analysed transcript and shots into study notes (free, no re-analysis). body: {focus?, language?}
- start: review → rendering (shots can be generated after this)
- reopen: done/error → review
- variant: Clone as another language version. body: {language}
- translate: Translate voice-over and on-screen text. body: {language|languages}
- checkpoint: Save a restorable version. body: {note}
- versions: List saved versions
- restore: Restore a saved version
- version_fields: Per-shot text fields of a saved version (compare an old version with the current shots; read-only)
- delete_version: Delete one saved version
- lint: Prompt lint (read-only)
- log: Generation log
- delete: Delete the project
- estimate: Exact HWT price to render the project's shots. args: {only?: [n…]}
- strip: 睇成條來源片嘅菲林條（回圖片）
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

Shot list: edit fields, reorder, pick which shots generate, approve/redo, frames, stills. render / render_all / render_frame spend HWT.
Actions:
- patch: Edit shot fields. body: {shots:[{n, ff_desc?, motion_desc?, vo_text?, on_screen_text?, refs?, …}]}
- reorder: body: {order:[n…]}
- add: Append an LLM-written shot to a scene. body: {brief, refs?, after?}
- select: Choose which shots to generate; the rest keep the source clip. body: {generate:[n…]}
- frame_from_output: Use a library image as a frame. body: {output_id, role: first|end|mid}
- accept: Approve a shot
- redo: Send a shot back for another take
- keep: Keep the source clip for this shot. body: {keep: bool}
- import: Copy a shot from another project. body: {from_rid, from_n, with_frame?, with_clip?, with_dur?}
- reframe: Change aspect ratio. body: {ratio, mode: crop|pad}
- vo_suggest: Write a voice-over line for the shot
- libclip: Put a library video into this shot. args {mode: use|ref|'', ref: {asset_id|output_id, in?}} — use = this shot plays that clip from `in` (no generation, free); ref = the clip feeds the model's video slot; '' = clear. A search_library moment's ref works as is.
- libclip_isolate: Keep a library clip's picture and sound separately. body: {video: bool, audio: bool} (video off + audio on = generate the shot and lip-sync to the clip's sound)
- clear_voice: Remove the user's own recorded voice from a shot
- add_still: Cover/ending/poster card. body: {output_id, kind, after_n, dur, label?}
- patch_still: Edit a still card
- remove_still: Remove a still card
- render 💰: Submit one shot (spends HWT) and return at once with its job_id — then call collect.
- render_all 💰: Submit every pending shot that is not already generating (spends HWT); returns job ids at once — then call collect. args: {only?}
- render_frame 💰: Submit an opening/end frame image (spends HWT); returns job_id. args: {role?}. Then collect with args.frame_jobs.
- collect: Check submitted jobs: adopts finished clips into their shots, logs failed ones (auto-refunded). args: {frame_jobs?: [{shot, job_id}]}
- head: 睇呢格來源片頭幀（回圖片）
- genstrip: 睇呢格已出片嘅菲林條（回圖片）
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

On-screen overlay layers (titles, captions, stickers) for a project.
Actions:
- set: Replace the whole overlay layer list. body: {layers:[{recipe, at, duration, props, shot?, off?}]} (max 24)
- list: Current layers
- add: Append one layer. args: {recipe, at, duration, props}
- remove: Remove layer by index. args: {index}
- recipes: Overlay recipe catalog (ids for layers). args: {lane?: overlay|cam|edit, cat?, lang?}
- preview: 睇某一秒疊層效果（回 PNG）。args {at}
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

AI director: script, re-plan, templates, co-director turn, auto references. A restorable version is saved before each call.
Actions:
- draft: body: {brief, keep_structure?, with_frames?, targets?}
- plan 💰: LLM re-plan of shots. body: {brief, shots?, keep_structure?, language?, rendition?: "cine" (film/TV-grade rendition: cinematic move per shot)}
- script 💰: LLM script from a brief. body: {brief, total_sec?, dry_run?, language?}
- template: Apply a scene template. body: {template_id, shots?, keep_structure?, dry_run?}
- smart 💰: AI co-director turn; returns ops. body: {message, sel?, language?}
- auto_refs: Auto-assign reference assets to shots
- auto_slots: Auto-fill reference slots. body: {shots?, overwrite?, brief?}
- casting: Cast list for the project
- casting_adopt: Adopt a finished casting image: saves it to the library as a character/location and binds it to the project. body: {name, job_id}
- import_production: Import a Director production's storyboard onto this project's shots; already-paid keyframes come along free. body: {production_id, shots?: [n…], with_frames?}
- clear_smart: Clear the AI co-director conversation (versions are kept)
- cast: 💰 出一張選角圖（角色設定／場景）。args {name, prompt?} → job_id；之後 studio_shots collect {args:{cast_jobs:[{name, job_id}]}} 收貨＋綁落專案
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

Folders and the library of outputs and uploads.
Actions:
- list: List folders
- create: body: {name, parent?}
- rename: body: {name}
- delete: Delete a folder
- move: body: {to, output_ids?, asset_ids?}
- library: Library listing (outputs + uploads)
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

素材腦：用戶上載咗嘅片／資料夾（素材集，已分析入庫）→ 一句話自動剪成片：揀最啱嘅片段、剪走重講口頭禪、補畫面、多語字幕，先出免費預覽，用戶批咗先正式出片。
Actions:
- guide: 流程同選項
- sets: 我嘅素材集（id、名、幾多條片、分析狀態）
- set: 素材集詳情。args {set_id}
- search: 喺素材集搵片段（用意思搵，唔使同字）。args {set_id, q}
- auto: 全自動起稿（免費）：args {set_id, brief, ratio?, captions?:[lang], target_sec?, broll?, layout?} → 開剪輯單＋出免費預覽
- edits: 剪輯單列表。args {set_id?}
- edit_get: 剪輯單詳情（狀態、預覽、EDL）。args {edit_id}
- edit_update: 改剪輯單：args {edit_id, edl?（成份 EDL：a 主軌、broll、captions、ratio）, name?} → 變返草稿
- preview: 出免費預覽（低解像、有水印）。args {edit_id}
- render: 💰 正式出片（按成片秒數收；出唔到全額退）。args {edit_id}
- status: 出片進度。args {edit_id}
- tighten: 精簡建議（免費）：args {clips:[{asset,in,out}]} → 剪走重講／口頭禪／長停頓
- broll: 補畫面建議（免費、唔改單）：args {a:[{asset,in,out}], layout?} → broll 項（放入 EDL 再 edit_update）
- broll_ai: 💰 AI 畫一張補畫面（每張另收，唔計入出片價）。args {text（嗰句講乜）, ratio?, at?, dur?}
- broll_ai_get: AI 補畫面進度。args {job_id}
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

編譯器（導演門 lane）：素材＋白話 → 驗過嘅劇本 → 揀模型出片。compile／refine 會收少量分析費。
Actions:
- options: 選單：用途、上限、導演風格、模型
- compile: 💰 白話＋素材 → 劇本（30 秒至幾分鐘）。args {text（用 @名 指素材，@speaks("…") 鎖死對白）, assets:[{name, kind, role?, note?, ref:{pillar,id}|{asset_id}|{output_id}}], seconds, aspect, shots?, creativity?, dialogue_language?, no_music?, director?}
- refine: 💰 用白話改劇本：args = compile 嗰份 + {change}
- adapt: 劇本 → 某模型嘅出片參數（唔出片）。args {result: compile 回嘅結果, model: <model id from list_video_models>, resolution?, aspect?}
- run: 💰 adapt 完即提交出片。args 同 adapt → job_id（之後 job {job_id}）
- job: 任何出片／出圖 job 嘅狀態同成品
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

角色揀選：出分鏡／出片之前問用戶用角色庫邊個角色做主角。支援 MCP Apps 嘅 host 會彈角色卡（有相，撳一下就揀）；其他 host 俾用戶開 pick_url 網頁揀，或者用戶答號碼由你 choose。揀好之後分鏡／出片帶 args.cast_pick:<pick_id>。
Actions:
- pick: 開一張角色揀選單（所有 ready 角色，或者 args.ids 指定嗰幾個）。回 pick_id、pick_url、編號候選、縮圖。
- show: 再彈一次揀選單（needs_cast 回嘅 pick_id）。args {pick_id}
- choose: 記低用戶揀咗邊個（內嵌卡自己會 call；用戶喺對話答號碼／名就由你 call）。args {pick_id, ids?|ns?|none?}
- thumbs: （揀選卡用）攞候選角色縮圖。args {pick_id}
- result: 睇用戶揀咗未（網頁／內嵌卡揀完 agent 用呢個攞結果）。args {pick_id} → status waiting|chosen、refs
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。

素材庫卡：喺對話入面彈用戶嘅角色／場景／道具／作品（有縮圖、可以搜尋），用戶撳揀幾個再撳「用作參考」，揀咗嘅會以對話訊息傳返嚟（avatars/<id>、output_id <id>），你放入 refs。冇 MCP Apps 嘅 host 就讀 text 清單。
Actions:
- show: 彈素材庫卡。args {pillar?: avatars|environments|items|outputs}。回清單（最新 60 個）。
- list: （素材庫卡用）攞某個分頁清單。args {pillar}
- thumbs: （素材庫卡用）攞縮圖 data URI。args {pillar, ids:[≤24]}
💰 = 會扣 HWT。單次 > 50 HWT 第一次會回 needs_confirmation＋confirm_token，問過用戶之後用完全相同嘅參數加 confirm_token 再 call。每條 MCP key 有每日上限。
